Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.81,0:00:17.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those who ceaselessly hone the art\Nof killing are known as masters.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.07,0:00:22.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These lethal abilities, dutifully\Npassed down through many generations,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.29,0:00:25.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,have become what are\Ncalled modified bloodlines.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.85,0:00:28.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the story of one such master,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.77,0:00:32.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hikaru Gero of the Poison Clan\Nand his greatest challenge yet,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.79,0:00:34.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to get married.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.25,0:00:57.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No mama, lots of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.77,0:01:02.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Run fun, fun, fun. You.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.65,0:01:03.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So cool, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.89,0:01:47.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kill or kiss
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.39,0:01:51.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.09,0:01:54.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kill a kiss, can't kill a kiss!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.75,0:01:57.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kill a kiss, can't kill a kiss!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.31,0:02:01.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kill a kiss, can't kill a kiss!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.91,0:02:13.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm Mei Kinosaki, I'm just your perfectly\Naverage everyday marriage swindler!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.09,0:02:18.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lately, I've been helping\NGero look for a bride.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.85,0:02:21.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At least, that was the original plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.13,0:02:25.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what am I doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.99,0:02:28.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This wasn't exactly in\Nthe job description.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.81,0:02:31.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This guy here is Piichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.95,0:02:33.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He started out as our enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.79,0:02:36.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But then we found out he was\Nafter the Beastmaster too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.03,0:02:38.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So we've been working together.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.03,0:02:42.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's scary good.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.85,0:02:44.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And kind of a freak.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.79,0:02:46.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His combat skills are off the charts.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.07,0:02:50.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And even after an explosion\Nshould have killed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.43,0:02:52.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One 10-hour nap later, he's good as new.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.59,0:02:57.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His dream was to open a\Ncafe with his girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.53,0:03:00.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And since their customers won't be\Nsafe with a bunch of psychos around,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.91,0:03:03.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he swore to take down the Beast Clan.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.29,0:03:04.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Talk about a dangerous guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.69,0:03:09.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think the store leads somewhere important?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.03,0:03:11.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's not even a master.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.99,0:03:14.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But he found a shortcut to\Nthe Clan's headquarters.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:12.40,0:03:15.44,Default,sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)\bord0\shad0\blur0.3\fs15\b1\fscx90\c&H1B2120&\fay-0.02\pos(373,112)}Normal route
Dialogue: 1,0:03:12.40,0:03:15.44,Default,sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)\bord0\shad0\blur0.3\fs15\b1\fscx90\c&H1B2120&\fay-0.02\pos(69.33,176)}Shortcut
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.45,0:03:19.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Plus, he killed some elite group called\Nthe Five Beastars in mere seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.21,0:03:21.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, they're done.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.37,0:03:22.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess the way is clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.07,0:03:24.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.05,0:03:44.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that the Karate Bear from earlier?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.85,0:03:47.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which means that guy must be...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.25,0:03:51.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Beast Master?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.77,0:03:55.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Byakko, buy me ten seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.39,0:04:00.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Modified Bloodline++, flash flash!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:58.77,0:04:02.40,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\an7\alpha&H35&\fnImpact\b1\blur5\bord2\shad0\fscx90\fs70\c&H9F90FB&\4c&H817DBA&\3c&H512BCE&\pos(19.5,15)}Modified Bloodline++
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.55,0:04:03.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:03.01,0:04:05.20,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\an9\alpha&H35&\fnImpact\b1\blur5\bord2\shad0\fscx90\fs70\c&H9F90FB&\4c&H817DBA&\3c&H512BCE&\pos(619.5,15)}Pumped Up\N{\fs43}(Swollen Carcass)
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.29,0:04:14.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Master Toshiro, I won't let you down.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.75,0:04:19.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even among the monsters of the underworld,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.29,0:04:22.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there are masters who are\Nshunned by the Beast Clan, Prius.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.87,0:04:27.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.29,0:04:30.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't even forge bonds\Nwith their partners.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.41,0:04:32.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are they a part of this clan?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.97,0:04:37.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I heard at one point they were tough, but\Nthese days they're just playing dress-up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.17,0:04:40.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mom, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.25,0:04:44.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll be okay, sweetie.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.09,0:04:46.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mommy just made a little mistake at work.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.19,0:04:49.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.79,0:04:51.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You need treatment.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.61,0:04:52.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why won't they help?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.67,0:04:54.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.77,0:04:57.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's my fault I'm hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.03,0:05:04.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remember, the hospital, only Beast\NMasters with partners can be healed there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.37,0:05:07.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Outcasts like us aren't permitted.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.31,0:05:09.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't we try?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.45,0:05:12.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yaku...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.37,0:05:14.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.19,0:05:16.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She needs some medicine!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.93,0:05:18.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll get you the rest!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.43,0:05:20.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm begging you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.61,0:05:30.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mom...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.53,0:05:31.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,are you...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.43,0:05:39.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When she died, why? Her?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.31,0:05:40.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.61,0:05:54.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel the same way.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.23,0:05:57.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't stand this shitty world.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.79,0:05:59.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not a damn thing about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.35,0:06:03.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How every little thing is tied\Ndown by these meaningless rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.63,0:06:09.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But all the trash is prey for us!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.97,0:06:12.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stick with me, kid, I swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.29,0:06:15.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're gonna devour this world, you and me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.45,0:06:19.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I lost everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.93,0:06:21.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But Master Toshiro found me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.93,0:06:23.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gave me a reason to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.45,0:06:25.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd do anything for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.79,0:06:29.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe we should serve\Nwild game at our cafe.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.03,0:06:32.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A one-hit KO?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.89,0:06:37.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not really about fighting for\Njustice or anything like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.01,0:06:38.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.05,0:06:42.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Beastmaster, if you plan\Non sacrificing people,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.65,0:06:45.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna have to stop you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.37,0:06:49.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.09,0:06:53.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How long are you gonna lie there?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.47,0:06:58.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.81,0:07:00.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I failed, Master Toshiro.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.19,0:07:03.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wasn't talking about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.83,0:07:06.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, it's complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.55,0:07:11.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The blood from 93 major and\Nminor branches of the Beast Clan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.15,0:07:17.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As well as six Masters, including\NGero, went into creating this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.49,0:07:22.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An impure abomination made just for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.89,0:07:52.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Frankenbeast.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.49,0:07:54.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hyakko!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:53.68,0:07:56.30,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\an7\alpha&H35&\fnImpact\b1\blur5\bord2\shad0\fscx90\fs65\c&H9F90FB&\4c&H817DBA&\3c&H512BCE&\pos(25,20)}Frankenbeast: Hyakko
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.57,0:08:00.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should see your faces!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.63,0:08:03.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dumbfounded you are by\Nthe sheer power before you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.93,0:08:10.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I regret to inform you all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.39,0:08:17.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The moment you challenged me in a caldera\Nlake, you forfeited any chance of victory!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.27,0:08:24.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All clear. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.31,0:08:25.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should keep moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.89,0:08:36.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I'm going to need a bigger knife.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.45,0:08:43.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's got to be something\Naround here I can use. Let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.65,0:08:48.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something large and heavy\Nand good for stabbing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.55,0:08:58.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This ought to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.11,0:09:01.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A giant skeleton, but from what?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.37,0:09:38.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.63,0:09:41.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So it's fast and strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.93,0:09:43.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not only that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.89,0:09:48.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Apparently it's got these abnormal\Nmuscles and bones, both tough and light.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.45,0:09:50.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On top of all that,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.99,0:09:54.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,its nervous system seems to let\Nit reshape its morphology at will.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.73,0:09:58.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He must have put a lot of\Nwork into making this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.99,0:10:00.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, how about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.43,0:10:02.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Worth a shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.07,0:10:11.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I can blind it and circle around\Nfrom behind, I can deal a fatal blow.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.39,0:10:16.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It predicted what I'd do?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.63,0:10:17.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.89,0:10:19.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It read my movements.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.41,0:10:22.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I might have to sacrifice\Nan arm to block in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.35,0:10:23.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope this doesn't hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.91,0:10:32.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But why can't I kill her? Ever since I\Nhad a knife, I've never had a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.23,0:10:33.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,had a problem killing anyone
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.79,0:10:34.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,including masters
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.93,0:10:37.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.07,0:10:42.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there's really
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.85,0:10:47.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,no mystery to it like I said\NKyako's got a custom blend of master
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.99,0:10:51.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bloodlines and that includes a\Nhealthy amount of your very own.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.69,0:10:57.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're fighting an upgraded\Nversion of yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.87,0:10:59.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Better in every single way.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.17,0:11:02.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,EG!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.29,0:11:17.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you mind answering that? Right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.55,0:11:20.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's my girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.23,0:11:25.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You there, Piichi?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:24.47,0:11:27.10,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord0\shad0\blur0.3\fnArial\frz302.5\fax0.3\fscy120\fay0.01\pos(340,148)\frx358\fry348\c&HD9DAD8&}Marin
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.81,0:11:27.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You won't believe what's happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.09,0:11:31.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did the Beast Clan assassins get her?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.91,0:11:32.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.15,0:11:35.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,King Goose just made an announcement.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.17,0:11:37.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're going on tour!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.79,0:11:39.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Celebrating ten years!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.53,0:11:40.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.45,0:11:46.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aomori, Aichi, Fukuoka, and the Budokan,\Nbut getting tickets is a literal nightmare.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.05,0:11:52.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, just wanted to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.31,0:11:55.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'd better clear your schedule, mister.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.59,0:11:57.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because I'd hate to go by myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.05,0:11:58.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Love ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.05,0:12:04.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha! That's it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.29,0:12:06.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I waited to kill you for that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.93,0:12:09.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could the little airhead\Nbe any more clueless?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.91,0:12:14.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The next time she'll be reunited with\Nher psycho boyfriend will be in a grave.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.63,0:12:15.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.73,0:12:25.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Marin, she knows exactly what's going on,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.79,0:12:30.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what protecting our\Nordinary life means to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.35,0:12:38.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what gets me fired up.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:41.02,0:12:43.05,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnGeorgia\bord0\shad0\blur0.3\fs26\fscx85\b1\c&H070707&)\pos(322,278)}Offer{\alpha&HFF&\t(120,121,\alpha&H00&)}ing
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.61,0:12:45.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you for real?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.52,0:12:48.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a little too late to start\Ntaking this fight seriously!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.05,0:12:57.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll crush him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.29,0:13:01.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Piichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.59,0:13:06.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can I beat this thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.39,0:13:08.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't make up for height,\Nweight, but we're talking to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.39,0:13:09.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe the joints are weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.53,0:13:11.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do monsters have accurate tendons?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.29,0:13:12.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, what about crucial ligaments?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.01,0:13:15.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You really can't walk without those.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.49,0:13:17.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What will Marin think about all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.57,0:13:19.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope she gets those kangoos together.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.53,0:13:22.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A chimera lunch special.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.41,0:13:26.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as I can remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.55,0:13:32.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My brain's always been a jumbled mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.49,0:13:39.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But right now, I can use that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.51,0:13:43.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My thoughts are messier than\Never, and deeper, and freer.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.27,0:13:46.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I'm going to unleash\Nevery last one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.95,0:13:50.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.61,0:13:53.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One stupid phone call.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.55,0:13:56.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And he's transformed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.61,0:14:00.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mind if I borrow your right arm?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.77,0:14:02.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He got a step ahead of my prediction.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.25,0:14:06.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.65,0:14:08.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is how you move your limbs.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.65,0:14:09.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm getting the hang of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.75,0:14:13.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you know, I think I'm going\Nto need a little more firepower.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.23,0:14:15.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.13,0:14:17.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, this should work.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.29,0:14:22.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm losing control over my nervous system.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.59,0:14:25.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't be beaten by him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.89,0:14:27.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's a nobody!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.93,0:14:33.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're gonna devour this world, you and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.53,0:14:41.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry about this. Nothing personal.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.09,0:14:46.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I've got to stop your boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.35,0:14:47.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guy's crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.79,0:14:49.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was nuts!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.35,0:14:52.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, are you okay, Piichi?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.19,0:14:54.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be good in a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.09,0:14:57.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just need a five-minute nap.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.73,0:14:58.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For real?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.99,0:15:10.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Master Toshiro, please drain my blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.03,0:15:12.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Every last drop.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.39,0:15:18.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Becoming one with you would be an honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.63,0:15:20.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The greatest.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.57,0:15:26.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.37,0:15:29.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'd better get out of here now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.27,0:15:32.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that blood?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.73,0:15:37.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, Byakko.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.07,0:15:41.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's you and me against\Nthe world full of prey.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.49,0:15:44.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's devour every last one of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.39,0:15:46.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Peach is in bad shape.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.15,0:15:48.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's not going anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.37,0:15:51.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The exit isn't far. No choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.19,0:15:53.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gotta run, Bart!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.89,0:15:56.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're not done playing yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.03,0:16:08.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry I'm late. What'd we miss?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.39,0:16:10.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perfect timing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.15,0:16:15.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's up Water Master?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.59,0:16:17.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm glad you could make it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.47,0:16:20.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm charging you extra\Nfor that Water Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.41,0:16:30.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hands work but I'm still not 100 yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.51,0:16:32.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It won't be long.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.57,0:16:33.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kinosaki?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.05,0:16:37.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know this is outside\Nyour job description.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.37,0:16:41.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I apologize, but I promise\Nwe'll make this quick...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.15,0:16:45.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,quick so you and I can get\Nback to dating. Lessons? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.85,0:16:52.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Beast Clan is one of
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.49,0:16:53.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the five great families.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.91,0:16:59.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The branch families tune their\Nmodified bloodlines allowing them
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.13,0:17:02.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to communicate with their animal\Npartners by enhancing a single.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.59,0:17:04.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,physical traits.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.71,0:17:09.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, for the main family, the\NDogo lineage doesn't have limits.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.01,0:17:10.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our limbs,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.89,0:17:14.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,our organs, even our five senses.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.51,0:17:18.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're tuned to perfection and\Nhave the powers of the entire
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.93,0:17:23.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,animal kingdom, making us monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.43,0:17:27.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the origin of our\NModified Bloodline. Beast Blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.09,0:17:31.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sheep, Goat, Deer, Camel,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.01,0:17:35.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Donkey, Hippo, Llama, Buffalo, Noon,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.43,0:17:41.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okapi, Kangaroo, Giant Anteater, Taper,\NFox, Tanooki, Boar, Rabbit, Weasel
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.47,0:17:47.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mark, Sink, Stove, Honor, Crisco, Spline,\NSquirrel, Squirrel, Koala, Amadillo
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.23,0:17:52.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Porcupine, Sloth, Seelight, Soul, Furzeeal,\NWalrus, Sea, Octopus, Shrine, Nautiland!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.73,0:17:58.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,93 species plus six masters makes\Na cocktail of 99 bloodlines!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.01,0:18:00.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The great Byakko!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.29,0:18:05.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An impure beast that allowed Byakko\Nto unleash her full potential.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.79,0:18:08.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But in the end, it was\Nmeant for one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.61,0:18:09.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To be prey!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.79,0:18:34.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're just an offering,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.19,0:18:39.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so that I, Toshiro Dogo, can\Nbecome the ultimate beast.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.73,0:18:41.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.97,0:18:42.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fujio!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.49,0:18:46.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kiro!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.91,0:18:50.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a heartwarming twist!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.37,0:18:55.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,team-ups always have me on the\Nedge of my seat but turns out
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.95,0:18:58.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,none of you are anything special
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.39,0:19:03.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what's your problem
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.91,0:19:07.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you better wipe
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.41,0:19:13.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that look off your face or I'm\Ngonna take my sweet time with you as
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.91,0:19:19.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,long as we all work together we've got We\Ncan bust out of this place, no problem!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.87,0:19:30.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.23,0:19:33.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone can feel it in their blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.67,0:19:38.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can still hear the screams of our\Npartners consumed by the Beast Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.23,0:19:44.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if we did manage to escape, we'll\Nnever get away from that monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.75,0:19:48.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the weakest member of the\Nclan isn't going to change that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.43,0:19:55.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll only hurt a short while.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.51,0:19:57.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Soon it'll all be over.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.23,0:20:01.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Until then, we must clear our minds.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.55,0:20:24.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Three doses?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.07,0:20:26.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But Gato...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.41,0:20:28.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Toxin! Triple dose!
Dialogue: 1,0:20:27.03,0:20:28.64,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an9\alpha&H15&\fnImpact\b1\blur3\bord1\shad0\fscx90\fs55\c&H9AC5E5&\pos(595,5)\3c&H4A6F95&}Toxin: Triple Dose
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.37,0:20:35.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's barely conscious.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.87,0:20:38.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't know when to quit, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.47,0:20:39.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, three doses?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.35,0:20:43.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After an OD like that,\Nyou gotta hurt like hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.01,0:20:46.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll put you out of your misery, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.13,0:20:54.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All those years thinning the family herd.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.43,0:20:57.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For this power of slaughtering\Nthem was worth it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.13,0:21:00.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look out, Gero!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.39,0:21:06.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was used to eating alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.51,0:21:11.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Getting to share a meal felt really nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.83,0:21:15.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jack!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.89,0:21:29.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An overdose means certain death.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.87,0:21:41.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But fighting to find a bride\Nhas led to something unexpected.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.47,0:21:42.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A mutation of sorts.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.17,0:21:57.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The eyesight of a falcon,\Nthe jump of a kangaroo,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.21,0:22:00.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and the deadliness of a cassowary.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.95,0:22:04.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll rip you apart before you\Nhave time to blink! Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.21,0:22:13.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want marriage.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.25,0:22:37.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Out of a spray, you ain't at\Nall. Both of you, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.75,0:22:39.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.23,0:22:45.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll see you. I think you are.\NThat's why I'm okay. I sent you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.93,0:22:55.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm fine
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.99,0:23:47.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One-on-one?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.87,0:23:49.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.09,0:23:50.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My bloodlust ran out ages ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.69,0:23:53.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Blood is not a curse.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:53.22,0:23:55.98,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnGeorgia\bord0\shad0\blur0.3\fs26\fscx85\b1\c&H070707&)\pos(326,278)}Heart and Soul
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.65,0:23:55.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Next time, heart and soul.

